  "caveats": [
    "Lab test rig (Gunt PT 500, SKF 6004) with artificial defects; real machines will differ.",
    "Headline metrics: leave-one-condition-out CV (unseen speed + recording setup combination).",
    "Features ignore loudness (spectral shape, envelope spectrum, crest factor, kurtosis, ...), and training adds simulated-microphone copies, so volume and mic colouring matter less.",
    "Prediction sets aim to contain the true class 90% of the time for recordings like the training data; coverage can drop for very different recording setups.",
    "A different microphone setup is much harder: leave-one-setup-out accuracy 42%. Record new machines the same way as the training data, or retrain with their recordings.",
    "Demo clips come from condition '1-1200', which the final model never saw."
  ]
